            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "yvetteski"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The rum and coffee liqueur combo was pretty tasty. I used diet cola and perhaps that accounted for the inability of my sweetened condensed milk to mix it.\n\nI think I'll try this one again.",
            "datePublished": "2007-12-28T18:51:41.997Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
